    "innovation": "This paper applies a trajectory-based method to quantify the effect of atmospheric circulation on 1979\u20132018 temperature trends, showing that removing this effect significantly reconciles observed monthly trends with CMIP5 climate model projections, reducing the mean square difference over global land areas by 42%.",
